---
// Instructor - Refined YAWARA style
---

<section class="instructor section" id="instructor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="instructor__inner">
      <div class="instructor__media fade-up">
        <div class="instructor__photo-wrapper">
          <div class="instructor__photo">
            <img src="https://overlimit-bjj.sakura.ne.jp/fsj41442/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/dummy-profile.jpg" alt="代表インストラクター" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22500%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20400%20500%22%3E%3Crect%20fill%3D%22%23EFEFEF%22%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22500%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20fill%3D%22%23999999%22%20font-family%3D%22sans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2214%22%20x%3D%2250%25%22%20y%3D%2250%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%3EPHOTO%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E';" />
          </div>
          <div class="instructor__badge">ASIA CHAMPION</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="instructor__info fade-up">
        <span class="section-label">Instructor</span>
        <h2 class="section-title--jp">インストラクター</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          アジアチャンピオンが直接指導。最高の環境で学べます。
        </p>

        <div class="instructor__profile">
          <h3 class="instructor__name">廣幡 翔大<span class="instructor__title">Yasuhiro Hirohata</span></h3>
          
          <div class="instructor__history">
            <p><strong>柔術歴：</strong> 2011年〜現在</p>
            <p><strong>帯：</strong> 黒帯</p>
          </div>

          <p class="instructor__bio">
            ブラジリアン柔術アジアチャンピオンの実績を持つインストラクターが、初心者から上級者まで丁寧に指導いたします。<br>
            長年のテクニックから実践的なポイントをお伝えする、それぞれのレベルに合わせた柔かな指導を心がけています。
          </p>

          <div class="instructor__socials">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 0.8rem;">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" /><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" /></svg>
              Instagram
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/304416070927536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 0.8rem;">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z" /></svg>
              Facebook
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .instructor {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: #FFFFFF; /* Clean white bg */
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .instructor__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
    gap: 8vh;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .instructor__photo-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #F8F9FA;
  }

  .instructor__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .instructor__photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    transition: filter 0.6s ease;
  }

  .instructor__photo-wrapper:hover .instructor__photo img {
    filter: grayscale(0%);
  }

  .instructor__badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -16px;
    right: 32px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px 24px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    background: #1A1A1A;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .instructor__profile {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

  .instructor__name {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  
  .instructor__title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #999999;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .instructor__history {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: #F8F9FA;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .instructor__history p {
    margin: 4px 0;
  }

  .instructor__bio {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 2;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .instructor__socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .instructor__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .instructor { padding: 80px 0; }
    .instructor__name { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    .instructor__badge { bottom: 16px; right: 16px; }
  }
</style>
